Skilled diggers architects and tree-cutters advance --- Vast crowd rushes like ocean at full moon --- Workers clear creepers stumps and fell trees --- Workers plant trees level pits and fill wells --- Workers raise tanks wells and altar-ringed ponds --- Sandal-sprinkled flower-decked road shines like heaven --- Overseers raise moated bannered camps like Indra city --- Adorned highway reaches cool fish-filled Gaṅgā
